# 🎬 Netflix Page Clone

A **Netflix page clone** created using **HTML5 and CSS3**, designed to closely match the visual layout and styling of the official Netflix India homepage.  
This project focuses on clean UI design, layout structure, and modern CSS styling without using any frameworks or JavaScript.

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5  
- CSS3  
- Flexbox  
- CSS Gradients & Overlays  
- SVG Icons  

---

## ✨ Features

- Netflix-style hero section with background image overlay
- Language selector (English / Hindi)
- Sign In button UI
- Email input with call-to-action buttons
- Trending movies section with ranking numbers
- Feature cards (TV, Downloads, Watch Everywhere, Kids)
- Frequently Asked Questions section UI
- Netflix-inspired footer with useful links
- Clean typography and color palette

---
